Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.09,0:02:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Somebody's in there! Thief! Thief!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.88,0:02:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.01,0:02:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... me?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.01,0:02:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.14,0:02:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no! I'm not a thief!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.39,0:02:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me! Me! Don't you recognize me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.52,0:02:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.37,0:02:56.70,Top,,0,0,0,,A burglary is believed to be underway. {?????????????????? ***jiken hassei}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.70,0:02:59.95,Top,,0,0,0,,A man believed to be the suspect \Nis currently causing a disturbance.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.95,0:03:02.98,Top,,0,0,0,,Any patrol cars in the vicinity, please respond.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.98,0:03:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger. Unit 11 is heading to the scene.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.94,0:03:09.13,Top,,0,0,0,,The man believed to be the suspect \Nis currently causing a disturbance.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.13,0:03:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Stop! I said stop! \NThis is all one big misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.79,0:03:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to apprehend the suspect. Moving in. {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.32,0:03:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, please! \NMr. Policeman, just listen to me!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.30,0:03:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.31,0:03:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I live here!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.91,0:03:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar! Nobody's lived next door \Nsince they moved away six years ago!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.17,0:03:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I was asked to keep an eye on the place.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.45,0:03:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So you broke in without permission, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.70,0:03:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The suspect appears to be delusional.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.93,0:03:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell did you come to that conclusion?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.21,0:03:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He could be high on something. Take him in!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.29,0:03:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyuki! You're Miyuki, right?! It's me!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.55,0:03:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Miyuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.02,0:04:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss, next time you go outside, please make sure you're properly dressed. Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{n-nooooo}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.31,0:05:36.48,Thought,,0,0,0,,Miyuki! You're Miyuki, right?! It's me!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.96,0:05:37.61,Thought,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.49,0:05:46.53,Thought,,0,0,0,,How did he know my name?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.53,0:05:48.87,Thought,,0,0,0,,M-Miyuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.26,0:05:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.22,0:06:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry! I was trying to cover your eyes, \Nbut my aim was a little off.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.68,0:06:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Risa, you are a second dan in karate! \NNo way you'd miss like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.77,0:06:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it really that shocking?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.03,0:06:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Having some stranger \Nsee your virgin naked body?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.78,0:06:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, your only complex \Nhas always been how small they are. {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.70,0:06:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Risa!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.20,0:06:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nya! Forgive me, Miyuki-san! {she says -tan for some reason - probably her shtick; I don't care, gonna make it the usual -san}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.25,0:06:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{?}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.73,0:06:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that peeping tom \Nwas actually your Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.68,0:06:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.32,0:06:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But he knew your name.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.24,0:06:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I must've heard him wrong. \NTomoya-kun would never do something like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.56,0:06:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, whatever you say. \NTomoya-kun is your prince, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.12,0:06:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like that...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.61,0:06:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad he moved away six years ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.08,0:07:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Your first love, and you \Nhaven't seen him once since then.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.57,0:07:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Six years away is a long time. \NMaybe he...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.24,0:07:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,looks like this now?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.28,0:07:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... don't tell me...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.16,0:07:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Masashi and Kyohei?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.71,0:07:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.31,0:07:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but how'd you know I was here?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.91,0:07:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My old man called me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.13,0:08:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Said my childhood friend \Ngot arrested for peeping.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.05,0:08:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Right... Your dad's the chief at this station.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.13,0:08:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure know how to make an entrance \Nafter coming back for the first time in six years.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.52,0:08:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously! {kono}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.92,0:08:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But I told them it was all a misunderstanding! \NThat I'm Sawada Tomoya!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.82,0:08:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we know.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.06,0:08:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're staying for the whole summer vacation, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.79,0:08:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah... more or less.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.33,0:08:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.57,0:08:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How was Miyuki-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.78,0:08:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Uh... heh...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.34,0:08:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man. Look at that goofy lewd grin. {dirty face}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.08,0:08:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.23,0:09:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyuki, don't cry anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.54,0:09:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to move away? \NI won't get to see you anymore, Tomoya-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.67,0:09:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Miyuki. \NStick your hand through that hole.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.16,0:09:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.57,0:09:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.76,0:09:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.26,0:09:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.03,0:09:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,See? It's okay! {??? mou sugu?}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.81,0:09:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! We can hold hands through it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.54,0:09:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.82,0:09:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard that story a thousand times already.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.07,0:09:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But you said yourself that Tomoya-kun \Nmight've grown up looking different. {?????? lit: after all, risa about tomoya, said he might've become a strange face - not sure what she means and even more how retelling this dumb story once again helps}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.79,0:09:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.08,0:09:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Risa...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.58,0:10:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready... go!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.80,0:10:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Think we pushed him a little too hard?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.56,0:10:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap! It's downhill from there!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.72,0:10:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.41,0:10:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.64,0:10:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.22,0:10:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.83,0:10:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody stop me!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.49,0:10:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.63,0:10:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.05,0:10:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saved...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.64,0:10:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? The peeping tom from this morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.68,0:11:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Him?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.98,0:11:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.61,0:11:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, I'm not...!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.11,0:11:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.87,0:11:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.82,0:11:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.12,0:11:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he say Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.72,0:11:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.18,0:11:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You really couldn't tell it was me?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.33,0:11:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... I never imagined it was actually you!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.09,0:11:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognized you right away though.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.22,0:11:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't changed a bit, Miyuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.65,0:11:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't changed?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.72,0:11:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He means her shape, see? {lit: it's about this thing - pointing at his chest - implying miyuki's chest is still just as flat}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.68,0:11:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch... right in the complex.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.73,0:11:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... N-No! That's not what I meant! Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.03,0:11:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean... Miyu—
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.94,0:11:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the worst!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.90,0:11:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.65,0:11:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... hey! Hang on!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.74,0:11:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give it up already.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.16,0:11:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I also had to give up on Kotono-chan, \Nmy first love from elementary school.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.12,0:12:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Her parents died in an accident, \Nand relatives took her away.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.10,0:12:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the last we ever saw of her.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.76,0:12:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,First loves never work out.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.10,0:12:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.61,0:12:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.24,0:12:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's serious.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.80,0:12:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really okay leaving things like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.05,0:12:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been looking forward \Nto seeing Tomoya-kun all this time.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.31,0:12:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All for your pride?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.95,0:12:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care. {it's ok}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.60,0:12:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Then maybe I'll take him for myself?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.77,0:12:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.81,0:12:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope. Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.67,0:12:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.76,0:12:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! An email.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.51,0:13:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.57,0:13:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.20,0:13:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from Anna-chan in America.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.19,0:13:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hi! Annie here. \NHow's my beloved Tommy doing?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.23,0:13:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.30,0:13:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, she's still adorable. \NUnlike somebody else.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.86,0:13:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was happy to know Tommy \Nmoved back to his old house!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.43,0:13:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And guess what? \NMy Japanese grandma lives very close by.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.25,0:13:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So I came up with a way to surprise Tommy. \NLook forward to it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.05,0:13:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sincerely yours, Annie."
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.84,0:13:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of surprise she means.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.92,0:13:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Tommy! I've missed you!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.32,0:13:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... um...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.06,0:13:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.60,0:13:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up... is that you, Annie?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.08,0:13:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! Tommy's Annie!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.20,0:13:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.40,0:14:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you read my email? \NI told you I was going to surprise you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.18,0:14:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,T-Then...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.32,0:14:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom's on a date, \Nand Grandma said I could stay here. {to visit}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.52,0:14:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? B-But Grandma...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.92,0:14:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma's on a package tour right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.64,0:14:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.91,0:14:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind if I use your shower?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.71,0:14:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Japanese summers are like a steam bath!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.57,0:14:46.04,Thought,,0,0,0,,Man... Americans really are something else. {what are ... thinking}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.04,0:14:47.87,Thought,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me Annie's here to... {??? no clue what he implies}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.92,0:14:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.88,0:14:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,T-This is bad...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.68,0:15:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Howdy...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.97,0:15:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally meet again after six years, \Nand we still haven't really had a chance to talk.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.58,0:15:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So... I'd really like to spend \Nsome time talking with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.31,0:15:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no way...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.79,0:15:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.45,0:15:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, I mean, not impossible...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.92,0:15:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,S-See, I'm here alone, and a girl \Ncoming over to a guy's house at night...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.22,0:15:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're thinking about my reputation!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.75,0:15:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... s-sort of...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.35,0:15:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, not exactly...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.17,0:15:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so kind, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.23,0:15:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one thing about you that hasn't changed!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.46,0:15:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyuki...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.01,0:15:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tommy! \NI feel so refreshed!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.51,0:15:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.07,0:15:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.91,0:15:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Uh... t-that's not...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.23,0:15:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are the worst!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.31,0:15:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, Miyuki! \NIt's a misunderstanding! I swear!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.52,0:16:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.74,0:16:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Anna, now isn't the time...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.02,0:16:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.37,0:16:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.67,0:16:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.80,0:16:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Annie... I...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.93,0:16:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Tomoya! \NLet's throw you a welcome-home party!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.64,0:16:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.18,0:16:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... well... this is...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.13,0:16:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Who's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.94,0:16:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Anna! Call me Annie!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.86,0:16:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.66,0:16:59.74,Thought,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember anymore, Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.92,0:17:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I'll come back someday. \NUntil then, you and I will each keep half of this.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.89,0:17:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come! Make sure \Nyou come back! Promise me!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.62,0:17:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.08,0:18:24.12,Thought,,0,0,0,,I don't have much time...\N What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.39,0:18:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.30,0:18:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you make up with Miyuki-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.51,0:18:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.65,0:18:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a lot more stubborn than she looks.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.64,0:18:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.34,0:18:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... if you go out with me, I might just tell you how to make up with her.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.30,0:18:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.83,0:18:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Go out with you... here?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.03,0:19:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to know \Nhow to make up with her?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.67,0:19:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.93,0:19:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.26,0:19:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... what?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.66,0:19:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks good to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.31,0:19:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that half-hearted answer?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.13,0:19:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how much longer is this gonna take?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.08,0:19:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.13,0:19:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay and look! {lit: look properly}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.84,0:19:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? I think my body's \Ndefinitely got Miyuki-san beat. {lit: emerges above}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.26,0:20:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I was asking what you think!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.57,0:20:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly... it doesn't suit you at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.31,0:20:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Ah... s-sorry. I didn't mean it like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.60,0:20:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then... what did you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.81,0:20:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just... that swimsuit \Nyou're wearing is so revealing.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.66,0:20:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,People around are going to stare.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.86,0:20:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's make sure they don't.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.75,0:20:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Risa-chan, what are you—
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.87,0:20:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been hearing about you \Nfrom Miyuki-san for years.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.11,0:20:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So when I met you yesterday, \Nit didn't even feel like our first meeting.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.59,0:20:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I fell for you before I even realized it, \Neven though I'd never actually met you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.23,0:20:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... do you dislike me?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.02,0:20:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You can't just ask me \Nsomething like that out of nowhere...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.31,0:20:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I really that unattractive?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.10,0:20:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not that...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.40,0:20:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then just give me a hug. \NJust for a little while.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.22,0:20:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh? B-But what if...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.88,0:20:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't, I'll scream my head off!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.71,0:20:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay... I'll do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.40,0:21:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.54,0:21:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.84,0:21:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Risa-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.80,0:21:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.86,0:21:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Tommy? Tommy! Are you here?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.74,0:21:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tommy!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.00,0:21:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Tommy
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.96,0:21:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tommy's gone!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:54.17,0:21:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He probably went shopping \Nby himself or something.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.90,0:21:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's already past noon.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.59,0:22:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't we go out too? \NI'll show you around town, Annie.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:06.08,0:22:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love that, nice guy! {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:50.73,0:22:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:51.95,0:22:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyohei's completely smitten with Anna-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:04.78,0:23:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotono-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:16.12,0:23:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... H-Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:30.78,0:23:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... Excuse me!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:34.48,0:23:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Taxi!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:37.65,0:23:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where to?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:39.50,0:23:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Please follow that bus.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:21.90,0:24:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:48.82,0:24:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ceremonial singing is so hard. {nagauta =  long epic song with shamisen accompaniment (developed in Edo in the early 17th century)}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:50.86,0:24:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure is.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:51.66,0:24:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:52.23,0:24:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you practice that song?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:53.66,0:24:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! I forgot...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:55.82,0:24:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better get practicing.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:00.23,0:25:02.17,Thought,,0,0,0,,Guess I was mistaken?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:02.17,0:25:03.84,Thought,,0,0,0,,No... I'm sure...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:07.99,0:25:10.07,Thought,,0,0,0,,That was definitely Kotono.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:24.17,0:25:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he still isn't home.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:27.47,0:25:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, where'd that Tommy wander off to?!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:31.39,0:25:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyohei? Kyohei!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:34.18,0:25:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... I-I wasn't looking, honest!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:43.65,0:25:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:49.50,0:25:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What are you...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:51.88,0:25:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my thanks for today. \NI had so much fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:55.20,0:25:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:25:57.04,0:26:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me, Kyohei... \Nwas that your first kiss from a girl?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:02.58,0:26:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're adorable, Kyohei! \NMaybe even cuter than Tommy. {lovely}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:19.81,0:26:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:26:20.70,0:26:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:22.82,0:26:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But... here? {in public}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:24.63,0:26:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's watching.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:26.36,0:26:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Still... even if no one's around...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:32.08,0:26:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared, Kyohei?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:35.04,0:26:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I'm not scared.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:37.71,0:26:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But... I thought you liked Tomoya.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:40.08,0:26:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, I think I've fallen for you, Kyohei.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:43.67,0:26:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Kyohei.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:59.14,0:27:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Annie!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:01.06,0:27:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come this far... \Nmight as well go all the way!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:04.73,0:27:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyohei...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:26.56,0:27:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first Valentine's chocolate I've ever gotten.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:29.88,0:27:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's my first time giving Valentine's chocolate to a boy.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:42.10,0:27:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:50.11,0:27:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell am I doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:52.71,0:28:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,K-Kyohei... such incredible spunk! {???????? can't hear shit}
Dialogue: 10,0:28:57.80,0:28:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm cumming!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:00.30,0:29:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at my limit too... {??? ore mo?}
Dialogue: 10,0:29:02.97,0:29:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes! {???????}
Dialogue: 10,0:29:19.62,0:29:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm... stay calm...
Dialogue: 10,0:29:44.00,0:29:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Mickey! {not a typo}
Dialogue: 10,0:29:47.85,0:29:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:49.83,0:29:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Mickey? \NMy name's Miyuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:54.12,0:29:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tommy, I'm home!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:57.82,0:29:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:30:01.16,0:30:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, he's the absolute worst!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:06.33,0:30:09.08,Thought,,0,0,0,,Stay calm... stay calm...
Dialogue: 10,0:30:14.84,0:30:19.74,Thought,,0,0,0,,Tomoya, our departure's been moved up \Nto the day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:19.74,0:30:26.20,Thought,,0,0,0,,I know it's hard having just three days left here, \Nbut I'm sure you'll make new friends in America, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:26.20,0:30:28.58,Thought,,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting for you at the airport.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:32.10,0:30:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:31:03.79,0:31:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading out!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:11.19,0:31:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:15.57,0:31:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:22.90,0:31:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry...
Dialogue: 10,0:31:25.49,0:31:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's another busy day today... let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:35.71,0:31:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:31:37.36,0:31:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding, as always.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:41.17,0:31:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? You're not very lively today. {quick on the uptake}
Dialogue: 10,0:31:46.93,0:31:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Tell them I'm skipping club today.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:51.06,0:31:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyuki... is it that time of the month?
Dialogue: 10,0:31:53.51,0:31:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Or did somebody find out about \Nwhat happened with Tomoya-kun yesterday?
Dialogue: 10,0:31:57.93,0:32:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Still... something feels off.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:07.33,0:32:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:09.37,0:32:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, hear me out!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:11.37,0:32:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving for America tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:14.92,0:32:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad's being transferred there this time.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:18.05,0:32:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We might not see each other again for years.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:21.59,0:32:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So I...
Dialogue: 10,0:32:22.54,0:32:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That has nothing to do with me! {/I'm not interested}
Dialogue: 10,0:32:35.02,0:32:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:39.52,0:32:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I left for America, \NI just had to see you.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:42.89,0:32:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I came back here!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:45.36,0:32:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar...
Dialogue: 10,0:32:47.45,0:32:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:48.84,0:32:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lie!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:50.36,0:32:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it isn't!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:51.75,0:32:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why...? \NWhy were you with that other girl?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:55.83,0:32:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,P-Please believe me, Miyuki. \NThere's no time left.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:58.86,0:33:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyuki! At least make up with him. \NAmerica's a long way away.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:05.80,0:33:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe him!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:07.46,0:33:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:33:08.07,0:33:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she's headed {\i1}there{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:10.48,0:33:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:13.97,0:33:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsk. Lucky girl. {/I'm jealous}\NGuess I'll back off this time.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:18.41,0:33:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What a waste. \NIgnoring a girl as good as me...
Dialogue: 10,0:33:46.34,0:33:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You remembered.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:47.68,0:33:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:33:48.80,0:33:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:58.94,0:34:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now our hearts are finally one again.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:02.69,0:34:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You still had it?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:04.60,0:34:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:06.39,0:34:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I threw away a toy like this ages ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:10.26,0:34:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That was six years ago, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:13.13,0:34:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I was the only one \Nstill clinging to those memories?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:17.87,0:34:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How convenient for you. Especially considering all the fun you've been having.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:23.63,0:34:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's all a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:25.54,0:34:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:26.29,0:34:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:27.87,0:34:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Annie's going out with Kyohei. \NThere's nothing between her and me!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:31.26,0:34:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I came back only to see you, Miyuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:35.47,0:34:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You... {????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:34:37.77,0:34:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,remembered? {???????? tomoya?}
Dialogue: 10,0:34:39.88,0:34:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:46.40,0:34:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:48.61,0:34:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:34:50.45,0:34:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who should apologize.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:52.07,0:34:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all! It's my fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:55.28,0:34:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's mine.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:56.42,0:34:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, mine!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:26.73,0:35:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're beautiful, Miyuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:30.61,0:35:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm embarrassed.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:50.34,0:35:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I stop? {iya? I assume he asks if she doesn't like it?}
Dialogue: 10,0:35:52.01,0:35:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No. If it's you, I don't mind...
Dialogue: 10,0:35:55.33,0:35:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to remember every part of me.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:17.80,0:37:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Annie-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:20.85,0:37:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again, Kyohei!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:23.04,0:37:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,See you again soon, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:25.49,0:37:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You promise?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:28.52,0:37:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyuki, I swear I'll come back.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:31.77,0:37:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'll be waiting for you, Tomoya.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:35.32,0:37:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's both keep holding onto these until then.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:41.79,0:37:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:43.20,0:37:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back before you know it.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:46.06,0:37:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tommy, time's up!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:49.42,0:37:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then...
Dialogue: 10,0:37:55.63,0:37:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care, Tomoya!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:00.05,0:38:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Miyuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:06.23,0:38:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? I thought you were dating Kyohei?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:09.62,0:38:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just a memory from Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:12.06,0:38:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tommy and I are going to be \Ntogether from now on, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:15.28,0:38:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 10,0:38:16.62,0:38:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... have you ever done it on an airplane, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:11.25,0:38:17.09,Song,,0,0,0,,Even if I wanted to keep this memory forever, {	Hohoemi o Matteru by Asada Youko; don't think this song was ever released outside this ova so naturally no lyrics anywhere; translating by ear}
Dialogue: 10,0:38:18.86,0:38:24.86,Song,,0,0,0,,The two of us from those days \Ndrift farther away
Dialogue: 10,0:38:26.13,0:38:31.60,Song,,0,0,0,,The farther apart we are
Dialogue: 10,0:38:33.57,0:38:39.84,Song,,0,0,0,,the more the feelings we promised each other wander through a maze
Dialogue: 10,0:38:39.84,0:38:54.56,Song,,0,0,0,,So send me your smile, turn it into the sky, \Ninto the stars, into the moon
Dialogue: 10,0:38:54.56,0:39:02.16,Song,,0,0,0,,I want to be wrapped in your great wings
Dialogue: 10,0:39:02.16,0:39:20.55,Song,,0,0,0,,So that someday both my heart \Nand my body can truly believe in love.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:20.55,0:39:24.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Can't forget you are mine
Dialogue: 10,0:39:24.25,0:39:32.23,Song,,0,0,0,,I'll be with you, with you forever
Comment: 1,0:39:32.23,0:39:35.23,Song,,0,0,0,,
